# Invalid: dangling model and route references

`WorkoutSet.exercise_id` references an `Exercise` model that is never
defined, and the GET route returns an undefined `Workout` model.

::app[name=broken-refs port=8080]

:::model[name=User]
- id: uuid [primary, auto]
- email: email [required, unique]
:::

:::model[name=WorkoutSet]
- id: uuid [primary, auto]
- exercise_id: ref(Exercise) [required]
:::

:::auth[provider=email]
session: cookie
:::

:::route[method=GET path=/api/workouts]
auth: required
returns: list(Workout)
:::

::
